{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOAlertStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are two types of statuses:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Non-functional statuses used for informational or decorative alert messages.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"They provide context or highlight content without implying a specific state, system event, or user action.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"These alerts are not tied to UX patterns such as success, error, or warning, and may use contextual or brand-related icons to enhance recognition or storytelling.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Functional statuses communicate specific system statuses, results, or user feedback:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each variant conveys a clear semantic meaning and must always be paired with its dedicated functional icon to ensure clarity and accessibility.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use functional alerts to inform user about state changes, confirmations, or issues that are directly connected to system logic or user actions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"These messages carry functional meaning and help guide user response or acknowledgment.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/accent(image:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/info","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/negative","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/neutral(image:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/positive","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/warning"],"generated":true,"title":"Enumeration Cases"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The status of the alerts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage"},{"type":"text","text":" background color and its icon color are based on this status."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOInlineAlert"},{"type":"text","text":" icon and text color are based on this status."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOAlertStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"enum","role":"symbol","title":"MISOAlertStatus","externalID":"s:14MISOComponents15MISOAlertStatusO","roleHeading":"Enumeration","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOAlertStatus","kind":"identifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOAlertStatus"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The status of the alerts.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage","isActive":true},{"text":" background color and its icon color are based on this status.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOInlineAlert","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" icon and text color are based on this status."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOAlertStatus"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus","title":"MISOAlertStatus"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus/neutral(image:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"neutral"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14MISOComponents9MISOImageV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MISOImage"},{"kind":"text","text":"?)"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Neutral status can be used as a generic informative alert without semantic meaning or colour association."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Suitable for a wide range of contexts — such as tips, general information, or descriptive labels — where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no specific feedback or urgency is required. Appropriate for help sections, dashboards, or onboarding flows."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/neutral(image:)","title":"MISOAlertStatus.neutral(image:)","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus\/neutral(image:)"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus/negative":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/negative","abstract":[{"text":"Negative status communicates a critical issue or error that prevents the user from proceeding until it is resolved. These alerts remain visible until","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the problem is fixed or dismissed by the user.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"This status displays a dedicated default icon.","type":"text"}],"title":"MISOAlertStatus.negative","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus\/negative","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"negative","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus/info":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Info status is used to share neutral system information or service updates that do not require immediate action. Ideal for background processes or status"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"messages where users simply need to stay informed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This status displays a dedicated default icon."}],"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"info","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MISOAlertStatus.info","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/info","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus\/info","type":"topic"},"doc://MISOComponents/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus/accent(image:)":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus\/accent(image:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accent"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14MISOComponents9MISOImageV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MISOImage"},{"kind":"text","text":"?)"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Accent status uses brand colours to draw attention to promotional or highlighted information while remaining non-critical. Ideal for marketing content,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"announcements, or feature highlights, where you want to subtly engage users without introducing functional semantics. Ideal for promotional banners,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"product updates, or customer engagement moments."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/accent(image:)","title":"MISOAlertStatus.accent(image:)"},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","alt":null,"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/MISOComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Components","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents","type":"topic","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The catalog of all components provided by MISO. It contains also ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views.","type":"text"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertMessage":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOAlertMessage","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOAlertMessage","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Alert message is a UI element that displays system feedback, status changes or required action; throughout detailed, prominent, persistent and actionable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"communication. Alert message includes functional icon and semantic colour, and may include as well a close button and\/or action link."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Alert Message does not disappear automatically and remains visible until dismissed or resolved by the user."}],"title":"MISOAlertMessage","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertmessage"},"doc://MISOComponents/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOInlineAlert":{"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoinlinealert","abstract":[{"text":"Inline alert is a lightweight UI element, placed in the content flow, that displays information, system feedback,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"status changes throughout short, prominent, persistent and non actionable communication. Inline alert includes functional","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"icon and semantic colour, and does not include a close button and\/or action link. Inline alert does not disappear and remains visible.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MISOInlineAlert","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOInlineAlert","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOInlineAlert"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOInlineAlert"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus/warning":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/warning","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus\/warning","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"warning"}],"title":"MISOAlertStatus.warning","abstract":[{"text":"Used to draw attention to potential issues or upcoming changes that might affect the user’s service or experience. Warnings encourage awareness but","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"typically do not block actions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This status displays a dedicated default icon.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus/positive":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"positive"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive status indicates that a task or process has been completed successfully. These alerts reassure users and confirm that no further action is needed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This status displays a dedicated default icon."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/positive","title":"MISOAlertStatus.positive","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus\/positive"}}}